## 🛠️ Development

### **Local Setup**
```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/MrGweeod/mlb-agent.git
cd mlb-agent

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Copy environment template
cp .env.example .env
# Then edit .env with your actual keys
```

### **Run Locally**
```bash
# Full pipeline (9 AM mode)
python main.py

# Web server only
python src/web/server.py
```

### **Testing**
```bash
# Manual pipeline trigger (requires server running)
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/run_full_pipeline \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer MLBparlays"

# Check today's scored legs
curl http://localhost:8080/api/legs?date=2026-05-14

# Check parlay recommendations
curl http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations
```

