## 🐛 Known Issues

### **Issue 1: Direction Feature Dominance**
- **Status:** Monitoring
- **Description:** ML model relies 70% on direction feature
- **Why:** Coverage was bugged during training, correlated with direction
- **Impact:** Model may still be biased; awaiting real-world validation
- **Mitigation:** Monitor for 7 days, retrain if needed

### **Issue 2: Low Coverage Population**
- **Status:** Expected, improves over time
- **Description:** Only ~7% of legs have coverage calculated
- **Why:** Requires 20+ games, early in season (May)
- **Impact:** Most selection relies on ML without coverage signal
- **Mitigation:** Coverage % increases naturally as season progresses

### **Issue 3: API Quota Monitoring**
- **SportsGameOdds:** 100K objects/month, using ~2K/day (66% headroom)
- **Anthropic:** Claude API for parlay analysis, ~$3.50/month usage
- **Status:** Both well within limits

