## 🎯 Roadmap

### **Phase 4: Post-Coverage Fix Validation (May 14-20)** ⏳ IN PROGRESS
- [ ] Validate coverage fix improves hit rates
- [ ] Monitor hits_under performance (target: 65%+)
- [ ] Track parlay hit rate improvement
- [ ] Decide if model retraining needed

### **Phase 5: Scoring Adjustment Tuning (May 20-27)**
- [ ] Reduce adjustment magnitudes (currently too aggressive)
- [ ] OVER_BOOST: 18 → 8
- [ ] UNDER_PENALTY: -26 → -12
- [ ] Monitor score distribution vs outcomes

### **Phase 6: Coverage Expansion (June)**
- [ ] Expand coverage to more stat types (rbi, walks)
- [ ] Add pitcher-specific coverage (K/9, ERA trends)
- [ ] Increase coverage population from 7% → 20%

### **Future Enhancements**
- Live odds tracking (monitor line movements)
- Multi-model ensemble (separate models per stat type)
- Advanced pitcher metrics (FIP, xERA, K-BB%)
- Weather integration (wind, temperature effects on run scoring)

